 "hasLongPostCover": 0,
 "article": {
  "blocks": [
   {
    "type": "RichText",
    "content": "BIBILAB, a Japanese company, has created a hoodie that allows cat owners to tuck their beloved furry friends into a giant kangaroo-style pouch while gaming."
   },
   {
    "type": "Media",
    "mediaId": "a4npR4m",
    "caption": "(via BIBILAB)"
   },
   {
    "type": "Media",
    "mediaId": "aYGj7px",
    "caption": "(via BIBILAB)"
   },
   {
    "type": "RichText",
    "content": "The Nyangaroo Hoodie 3 (にゃんガルーパーカー3) is available in sizes M and L. It is currently listed for ¥8,900 ($56.37) on the [official BIBILAB store on Amazon](https://www.amazon.co.jp/BIBILAB-%E3%83%93%E3%83%93%E3%83%A9%E3%83%9C-%E6%8A%B1%E3%81%A3%E3%81%93%E7%B4%90-%E3%81%AB%E3%82%83%E3%82%93%E3%82%AC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%91%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%EF%BC%93%E3%81%8A%E8%85%B9%E3%81%AE%E3%83%9D%E3%83%83%E3%82%B1%E3%81%AB%E7%8C%AB%E3%82%92IN%EF%BC%81%E3%81%AC%E3%81%8F%E3%82%82%E3%82%8A%E3%82%92%E6%84%9F%E3%81%98%E3%82%8B%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0%E3%82%A6%E3%82%A7%E3%82%A2-LCF-100L-GY/dp/B0HLDNQ81T)."
   },
   {
    "type": "RichText",
    "content": "The product is the latest iteration in the \"Nyangaroo Hoodie\" loungewear line, which is characterized by a giant pouch located at the front. By nestling a pet cat inside the pouch, gamers can fully immerse themselves in gameplay with both hands free."
   },
   {
    "type": "RichText",
    "content": "The hoodie features a spacious, box-shaped front pouch measuring 40 cm wide by 23 cm tall with an 8 cm depth. Designed with maximum comfort in mind to encourage longer stays, the pouch easily accommodates large breeds and chubbier cats."
   },
   {
    "type": "Media",
    "mediaId": "a3GvRd3",
    "caption": "(via BIBILAB)"
   },
   {
    "type": "Media",
    "mediaId": "aMdeY1M",
    "caption": "(via BIBILAB)"
   },
   {
    "type": "Media",
    "mediaId": "a6DrNdL",
    "caption": "(via BIBILAB)"
   },
   {
    "type": "RichText",
    "content": "The pouch uses a thick, stretch-resistant brushed-back fleece on the exterior, paired with a soft boa lining on the interior that cats love. The inner lining is completely removable for easy hair cleaning and washing to maintain hygiene. Additionally, the pouch includes a support cushion to keep it structured alongside adjustable drawstrings, removing the need for owners to support the cat with their hands."
   },
   {
    "type": "Media",
    "mediaId": "aXLZjE9",
    "caption": "(via BIBILAB)"
   },
   {
    "type": "RichText",
    "content": "New features introduced in this series include built-in \"cat toy strings.\" The drawstrings attached to the cat-eared hood feature cat toy attachments on the ends. Crafted in a shape popular with felines and colored in a vibrant blue—a color easily visible to cats—the strings allow owners to play with their pet while tucked inside the pouch."
   },
   {
    "type": "Media",
    "mediaId": "aoWm5zw",
    "caption": "(via BIBILAB)"
   },
   {
    "type": "RichText",
    "content": "Another new addition is the \"cat-cam smartphone pocket.\" Positioned near the chest, this pocket allows owners to let their phone capture cute moments as they happen. The depth of the pocket is specifically calibrated to leave the camera lens exposed, allowing hands-free recording of the cat inside the pouch as long as the camera app is running."
   },
   {
    "type": "Media",
    "mediaId": "axWE721",
    "caption": "(via BIBILAB)"
   },
   {
    "type": "Media",
    "mediaId": "arW1oep",
    "caption": "(via BIBILAB)"
   },
   {
    "type": "RichText",
    "content": "The Nyangaroo Hoodie 3 is available for purchase via the [BIBILAB Amazon Store](https://www.amazon.co.jp/BIBILAB-%E3%83%93%E3%83%93%E3%83%A9%E3%83%9C-%E6%8A%B1%E3%81%A3%E3%81%93%E7%B4%90-%E3%81%AB%E3%82%83%E3%82%93%E3%82%AC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%91%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%EF%BC%93%E3%81%8A%E8%85%B9%E3%81%AE%E3%83%9D%E3%83%83%E3%82%B1%E3%81%AB%E7%8C%AB%E3%82%92IN%EF%BC%81%E3%81%AC%E3%81%8F%E3%82%82%E3%82%8A%E3%82%92%E6%84%9F%E3%81%98%E3%82%8B%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0%E3%82%A6%E3%82%A7%E3%82%A2-LCF-100L-GY/dp/B0HLDNQ81T), but it seems to be out of stock now. Detailed specifications and sizing information can be found on the official product website."
   },
   {
    "type": "Media",
    "mediaId": "aWpBEZK",
    "caption": "(via BIBILAB)"
   }
  ],
